    <unit id="21" name="GenerateFromTreeDataTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Generate from tree data</source>
        <target state="translated">由树数据生成</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="22" name="GenerateFromTreeDataDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The tree structure can be populated using treeData property. This is a quick and easy way to provide the tree content.</source>
        <target state="translated">可以使用 treeData 属性填充树结构，这是一种快速简单地提供树内容的方式。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
