    <unit id="38" name="MaxCountDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>You can set the maxCount prop to control the max number of items can be selected. When the limit is exceeded, the options will become disabled.</source>
        <target state="translated">可以设置 maxCount 属性控制最多可选项数量。超过限制后，选项会变为禁用状态。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
